 * reaches new tenants at provisioning; reach existing tenants with a tenant migration.
 *
 * An unknown role, or a role with no privileges here, grants nothing. Provisioning REFUSES to finish (the tenant
 * is marked provisioning_failed and no token is issued) when the owner role has no privileges: keep it filled in.
 *
 * Role codes: lower-case words and digits joined by `_`. Privilege codes: lower-case, may contain `.`, `:`, `-`.
 */
return [
    'owner' => [
        'tenant.manage',
    ],
];
